      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since we are testing multiple ciphers, let\u0027s also make it easier to diagnose\nwhich tests failed by using a test table like this:\n\nvar tests \u003d [...]struct{\n    fn CipherFunction\n    name string\n} {\n    0: {Cipher3DES, \"Cipher3DES\"},\n    1: {CipherCAST5, \"CipherCAST5\"},\n    // and so forth\n}\n\nand then on failures\n\nfor i, tt :\u003d range tests {\n   t.Errorf(\"#%d cipher(%s) err\u003d%v\", i, tt.fn, err)\n   ...\n}",
